<section class="docs-home-section">
  <p class="ns-eyebrow">Copy-source</p><h2>Know what you own</h2><p>Every scaffolded file carries an ownership tag. <code>[owned]</code> files hold your product code, a generator rewrites <code>[generated]</code> files, and <code>[guidance]</code> files describe the local conventions for people and coding agents. The <a href="{{ '/quickstart/#know-what-you-own' |> url }}">quickstart</a> shows the full tree.</p>
